1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:01,500
Every coal power plant

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,833
in India must now

3
00:00:02,833 --> 00:00:05,100
burn biomass along with coal.

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,700
It's called co-firing.

5
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:07,967
And from this year,

6
00:00:07,967 --> 00:00:09,367
the target is 7%.

7
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:10,933
That one rule

8
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:13,300
creates huge repeating demand.

9
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,000
An estimated 15 to 20 million

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,700
tonnes of biomass pellets every year.

11
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,467
Today,

12
00:00:19,567 --> 00:00:21,933
India makes only around 2.5 million.

13
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,200
That gap is the opportunity.

14
00:00:24,367 --> 00:00:25,633
For pellet makers,

15
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:27,900
straw aggregators and machinery builders.

16
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,167
IndiaBiomass is being built

17
00:00:30,167 --> 00:00:31,933
